{"id":"n90334-1-16","stage":5,"title":"세차다 · 强劲","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90334-1-16-1","ko":"오늘 배를 꼭 타야 하는데 큰일이군.","zh":"今天必须坐船，这下可麻烦了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"배를","meaning":"船","explanation":"배：船；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29729","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배를","audio":"/audio/8d62500623ac2523536a.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定。","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"타야","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타야","audio":"/audio/37207ef76f0932d325f8.mp3"}},{"text":"하는데","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는데","audio":"/audio/f78512dad8d31fc58a77.mp3"}},{"text":"큰일이군.","meaning":"大事","explanation":"큰일：大事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"큰일","audio":"/audio/dbfb08997ec518d3dc88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72174","s